   "gloss": "Where do you live?",
   "note": "The whole chapter is about the home but never teaches how to ask where someone lives. 'Locuiești' is the textbook verb; in everyday speech 'Unde stai?' (literally where do you stay) is just as common for where you live. Answer with the dwelling words: la bloc, într-un apartament. Take the question whole.",
   "confidence": "high"
