   "lang": "en",
   "voice": "en_narrator",
   "text": "And those polite pronouns. Dumnealui and dumneaei are correct and genuinely respectful — but formal. You would use them about someone older, a superior, in an office. Among people your own age, el and ea are perfectly neutral.",
